        "instruction": "Put the investigation planning steps in a sensible order.",
        "items": [
          "Ask whether temperature affects how quickly water evaporates.",
          "Choose temperature as the independent variable.",
          "Keep starting volume, cup type, surface area, and measuring times the same.",
