        "instruction": "Order the steps in the sealed-bag reaction investigation.",
        "items": [
          "Place baking soda and vinegar in a sealed plastic bag setup.",
          "Measure the mass of the sealed system before the reaction.",
          "Allow the substances to react and produce gas inside the sealed bag.",
          "Measure the mass of the sealed system after the reaction.",
          "Use the similar before-and-after masses as evidence that matter was conserved."
